art-end-frames-feature-is-now-live#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.minimax.io"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"What's New","item":"https://www.minimax.io/news"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"MiniMax-Hailuo-02 Start & End Frames Feature is Now Live, Mastering Complex Instructions and Extreme Physics-Based Dynamics","item":"https://www.minimax.io/news/minimax-hailuo-02-start-end-frames-feature-is-now-live"}]}]}</script><main class="flex flex-col items-center w-full overflow-y-auto flex-1 pb-[160px] min-h-screen"><div class="px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[1000px] flex flex-col items-center mt-[80px]"><div class="text-brand-1 text-[14px] font-[400] leading-[21px] mb-[24px]">Aug, 28, 2025</div><h1 class="m-0 p-0 text-center text-brand-1 text-[54px] font-[500] leading-[86.4px] pb-[36px]">MiniMax-Hailuo-02 Start &amp; End Frames Feature is Now Live, Mastering Complex Instructions and Extreme Physics-Based Dynamics</h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center py-[16px]"><a target="_blank" class="no-underline p-[8px_24px] rounded-full flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-1 text-col-bg-00 mr-[16px] hover:opacity-90 transition-all duration-300" href="https://hailuoai.video/create"><p class="p-0 m-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[19px]">Try Now</p><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M3.33337 8H12.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33334L12.6667 8.00001L8 12.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a><a target="_blank" class="no-underline p-[8px_24px] rounded-full flex items-center gap-2 border border-solid border-brand-1/80 text-brand-1 hover:bg-col-bg-01 transition-all duration-300" href="https://www.minimax.io/platform/document/video_generation?key=66d1439376e52fcee2853049#whYrra7nHOP2eZy9yMMbnnU6"><p class="p-0 m-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[19px]">API Platform</p><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M3.33337 8H12.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33334L12.6667 8.00001L8 12.6667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">Since the launch of MiniMax Hailuo 02, we have been continuously exploring the next frontier in video generation technology. Today, we are thrilled to announce a significant update: the "Start and End Frame" feature is now officially live on our web and mobile platforms, accompanied by the innovative "End Frame Only" feature.<br/><br/>
Both 768p and 1080p resolutions support the Start and End Frame and End Frame Only functionalities. The Start Frame functionality is supported for 512p.</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] my-[48px]"><div class="w-full h-[432px] relative cursor-pointer"><div class="absolute bottom-[0px] left-0 w-full h-[98px] rounded-b-[12px] py-[40px] px-[20px] z-10" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0%) 9.78%, rgb(0 0 0 / 60%) 100%)"><div class="flex items-center"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-[14px] text-[#fff] leading-normal ml-[8px]">00:00<!-- --> / <!-- -->00:00</div></div><div class="mt-[12px] w-full h-[2px] rounded-[100px] bg-white/20"><div class="h-full bg-white/40 rounded-[100px]" style="width:0%"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">The first generation of start-and-end-frames technology often suffered from poor instruction comprehension, limited application scenarios, and high error rates. Hailuo AI's next-generation start-and-end-frame functionality is engineered to deliver a superior experience through industry-leading instruction following, seamless motion dynamics, and boundless creative potential, establishing a new industry benchmark.<br/><br/><br/></div><h3 class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[24px] font-[500] leading-[36px] mb-[16px]">Five Core Advantages Establishing a Generational Lead</h3><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline"><strong>1. Unmatched Adherence to Complex Instructions</strong><br/>
We fulfill every detail of your creative vision. The model demonstrates exceptional adherence to complex and detailed prompts, from rapid zoom-ins to intricate character animations and specific motion requirements, ensuring that what you describe is what you get.</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] my-[48px]"><div class="w-full h-[432px] relative cursor-pointer"><div class="absolute bottom-[0px] left-0 w-full h-[98px] rounded-b-[12px] py-[40px] px-[20px] z-10" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0%) 9.78%, rgb(0 0 0 / 60%) 100%)"><div class="flex items-center"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-[14px] text-[#fff] leading-normal ml-[8px]">00:00<!-- --> / <!-- -->00:00</div></div><div class="mt-[12px] w-full h-[2px] rounded-[100px] bg-white/20"><div class="h-full bg-white/40 rounded-[100px]" style="width:0%"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">Prompt: "A blank sheet of paper lies flat on a tabletop. The camera executes a rapid push-in from a wide shot, then immediately begins to orbit around the paper. Lines emerge and intertwine across the page like nimble sprites, as colors gradually bloom and spread. As the camera slowly rises, the lines and colors continuously converge and combine, making the silhouette of a building gradually clear. The final shot freezes on the completed architectural drawing, showcasing the magnificent building, perfectly rendered as if it has risen straight from the paper itself."<br/><br/><br/><br/></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline"><strong>2. Extreme Physics-Based Motion Dynamics</strong><br/>
Building on Hailuo 02's unique capabilities, this feature flawlessly handles complex physical movements. Action sequences, gymnastics, and parkour are rendered with unparalleled smoothness and continuity, showcasing silky-smooth motion.</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] my-[48px]"><div class="w-full h-[432px] relative cursor-pointer"><div class="absolute bottom-[0px] left-0 w-full h-[98px] rounded-b-[12px] py-[40px] px-[20px] z-10" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0%) 9.78%, rgb(0 0 0 / 60%) 100%)"><div class="flex items-center"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-[14px] text-[#fff] leading-normal ml-[8px]">00:00<!-- --> / <!-- -->00:00</div></div><div class="mt-[12px] w-full h-[2px] rounded-[100px] bg-white/20"><div class="h-full bg-white/40 rounded-[100px]" style="width:0%"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline"><strong>3. Dynamic and Cinematic Camera Control</strong><br/>
Achieve a new level of artistry with dramatic camera movements. Effortlessly create spatial pans, transformative transitions, and perspective shifts for a truly cinematic feel.</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] my-[48px]"><div class="w-full h-[432px] relative cursor-pointer"><div class="absolute bottom-[0px] left-0 w-full h-[98px] rounded-b-[12px] py-[40px] px-[20px] z-10" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0%) 9.78%, rgb(0 0 0 / 60%) 100%)"><div class="flex items-center"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-[14px] text-[#fff] leading-normal ml-[8px]">00:00<!-- --> / <!-- -->00:00</div></div><div class="mt-[12px] w-full h-[2px] rounded-[100px] bg-white/20"><div class="h-full bg-white/40 rounded-[100px]" style="width:0%"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline"><strong>4. Creativity Beyond Expectations</strong><br/>
Hailuo AI excels at bridging wide conceptual gaps between the start and end frames, delivering surprising and delightful results. Even with minimal instructions, our AI demonstrates exceptional creativity, turning simple prompts into extraordinary visual narratives.</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] my-[48px]"><div class="w-full h-[432px] relative cursor-pointer"><div class="absolute bottom-[0px] left-0 w-full h-[98px] rounded-b-[12px] py-[40px] px-[20px] z-10" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0%) 9.78%, rgb(0 0 0 / 60%) 100%)"><div class="flex items-center"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-[14px] text-[#fff] leading-normal ml-[8px]">00:00<!-- --> / <!-- -->00:00</div></div><div class="mt-[12px] w-full h-[2px] rounded-[100px] bg-white/20"><div class="h-full bg-white/40 rounded-[100px]" style="width:0%"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline"><strong>5.  "End Frame Only" Suppotred</strong><br/>
This unique feature allows you to define the destination and let the AI generate the journey. Start with the end in mind and watch as Hailuo AI crafts a magical visual story leading up to it.</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] my-[48px]"><div class="w-full h-[432px] relative cursor-pointer"><div class="absolute bottom-[0px] left-0 w-full h-[98px] rounded-b-[12px] py-[40px] px-[20px] z-10" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0%) 9.78%, rgb(0 0 0 / 60%) 100%)"><div class="flex items-center"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fa533807b-9ff6-4f86-a72e-8eb31d0245c1.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><div class="text-[14px] text-[#fff] leading-normal ml-[8px]">00:00<!-- --> / <!-- -->00:00</div></div><div class="mt-[12px] w-full h-[2px] rounded-[100px] bg-white/20"><div class="h-full bg-white/40 rounded-[100px]" style="width:0%"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">Prompt:
"The camera rapidly soars upward, transforming into a fire phoenix."<br/><br/><br/><br/></div><h3 class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[24px] font-[500] leading-[36px] mb-[16px]">Enhanced Application Scenarios with Precise Control</h3><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline"><strong>E-commerce Advertising: Cinematic Product Displays</strong>
