<br/><br/><br/><br/></div><h3 class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[24px] font-[500] leading-[36px] mb-[16px]">One More Thing…</h3><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">As a special highlight, the start-and-end-frame functionality also supports detailed animation of text and logos. As demonstrated in our launch video, complex effects like logo formations and text fly-ins are now easily achievable.
