"The camera rapidly pushes in on a conch shell. Inside, cosmic formations converge to form a logo as text flies in, word by word."<br/><br/><br/></div><h3 class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[24px] font-[500] leading-[36px] mb-[16px]">Join Our Creative Challenge!</h3><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">
To celebrate the launch of the Start and End Frame feature, Hailuo AI is officially kicking off the first <strong>"AI Video Riddle" Creative Challenge! </strong>We provide the "riddle" (the story's beginning and end), and you create the "answer" (the story that connects them).<br/>
Below are the 'first frame' and the 'last frame' of a story. What happened in between? Why did it end this way? Use Hailuo AI's Start and End Frame functionality to generate a video that reveals your version of the truth. Fabulous prizes await the most imaginative creators!</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] py-[48px]"><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="relative max-w-full overflow-hidden" style="width:768px;height:201.79199999999997px"><img alt="Start Frame &amp; Last Frame" fetchPriority="high" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="rounded-[12px] object-contain object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F8463bf8d-7b4e-41fd-a46b-9b22253db527.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="mt-[16px] flex items-center justify-center"><p class="m-0 p-0 text-co